<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian drones have hit Kurdish opposition camps and the Komala headquarters in northern Iraq, while Israeli strikes have targeted weapons depots and air-defence warehouses inside the country. Baghdad has accused Israel of the attacks and is probing the closure of Iran border crossings amid protests, while the United States and Iraq discussed strengthening joint cooperation. Iraq’s foreign minister discussed expanding Iraq’s role in UN peacekeeping operations. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQVjZsa0VQLXpyOFdSUVZpMTE4UjRDaEI1WHlXbUF6d1ZFNTVlZ09SbTNzSXM3RHpmOHVhMERLUmxySXVTcHB5STZMV2RucnFUdjJTQ2Q4TzlHYVcwZmI3ZkVSc25ySzVWQU1XY1hqa2RyXzBBQ2VZelpOSkhJLVVsODJMTWM2Z1pGV1lXZHNTd1JRZ01YMjJqcHhBSEd0eVpDN0RtUTNPdndFcFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Мілітарний&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiRkFVX3lxTFBFZXREbUp1RkJBcWVRWnQxTVFHVUJXdGlLZ3FZT1pIUXRDUW9CdC1SZFdrVVhYbTQ5N05sVXNnbk55RmpoVGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;وزارة الخارجية العراقية&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNaWhYc1pNTm5EX1JMdVJLVFBQVjNlVmpsYlRZQllzanZzODB4MlJjUVlyczN5QXRVU1FTRVpZczZEcEszRm5XTHVEc0dmZ1pnQnVwNzM5aVg5dEc0STNtNkFvR29RdW03NWhGd3o4bl9VS1NNT1M4RF9OU180ZXZLUFJkZlRNeWtObllkN0l6UHQ3QUhPRzJ5aw?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOR3h0bHREM2c5Rkc0NEZHU0cxWkJZc0VGM1d